WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:08.069
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:11.178
What do they see?

3
00:00:11.179 --> 00:00:31.359
They see a bowling alley.

4
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:48.714
The blobs are ready to bowl.

5
00:00:48.715 --> 00:01:01.509
They push a chair.

6
00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:10.275
They push a table.

7
00:01:10.276 --> 00:01:19.468
They push buttons.

8
00:01:19.469 --> 00:01:47.687
They push a bowling ball.

9
00:01:47.688 --> 00:02:10.889
They push bowling pins.

10
00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:17.680
They push the pin machine.

11
00:02:17.681 --> 00:02:22.361
Uh-oh. The machine is stuck.

12
00:02:22.362 --> 00:02:36.610
The blobs push very hard.

13
00:02:36.611 --> 00:02:39.508
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:39.509 --> 00:02:41.961
Good-bye!

